===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{term|actus reus||guilty act|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|actus|āctus|act|lang=la}} + {{term|reus||guilty|lang=la}}, after {{term|mens rea|lang=la}}.

